@startuml
participant Alice
participant Bob

Alice -> Bob: hello
note left
  A note with a list:
  * first
  ** nested
  *** deeper
  * second
  # numbered
  ## nested number
end note

note over Alice, Bob #FFAAAA
  |= Key |= Value |
  | a    | 1      |
  | b    | 2      |
end note

hnote over Alice
  <b>bold</b> and
    indented text
end hnote

rnote right of Bob
  Tree:
  |_ one
    |_ two
  |_ three
endrnote

/ note right of Bob: one line

legend right
  Legend with code:
  <code>
    if (x) {
      y();
    }
  </code>
endlegend

title
  Multi-line
  <i>title</i>
end title

header
  Page header
end header

footer
  Page footer
end footer

caption
  Figure 1
end caption
@enduml
